        <mxCell id="title_3" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:#F8FAFC;letter-spacing:1px;&#x27;&gt;⚡ ATHER &amp;nbsp;—&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&#x27;font-weight:600;color:#38BDF8;&#x27;&gt;SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE &amp;amp; INTELLIGENCE PIPELINE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:12.5px;color:#94A3B8;margin-top:6px;font-weight:500;&#x27;&gt;Automated Telemetry Health &amp;amp; Environmental Reliability &amp;nbsp;•&amp;nbsp; 5-Layer Thermodynamic Physics &amp;amp; Kinematic Anomaly Detection &amp;nbsp;•&amp;nbsp; Conformal Evidence Fusion &amp;amp; Operational Root Cause Diagnostics&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
