        <mxCell id="t1_51" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;margin-bottom:6px;&#x27;&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;background-color:#9333EA;color:#ffffff;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;&#x27;&gt;FAULT INJECTION CATALOG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#6B21A8;margin-bottom:4px;&#x27;&gt;Predefined Fault Scenarios&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:11px;color:#475569;line-height:1.35;&#x27;&gt;• TEMPERATURE_SPIKE (+11.5°C step jump)
• FROZEN_SENSOR (Zero variance stuck values)
• CALIBRATION_DRIFT (Accumulating +0.3°C/day)
• IMPOSSIBLE_HUMIDITY (Negative or 110% RH)
• ASPIRATION_SHIELD_FAILURE (Solar overheating)
• SEVERE_MICROBURST (Genuine extreme event)
• COMBINED_SENSOR_FAILURE (Cross-channel)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C084FC;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#6B21A8;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
