        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t2_52" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;margin-bottom:6px;&#x27;&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;background-color:#9333EA;color:#ffffff;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;&#x27;&gt;SYNTHETIC TELEMETRY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#6B21A8;margin-bottom:4px;&#x27;&gt;Synthetic Scenario Generator&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:11px;color:#475569;line-height:1.35;&#x27;&gt;• Baseline reading generator (Default: 32°C, 1013 hPa, 55%)
• Target station observation sequence synthesis
• Synthetic neighbor stations with lat/lon offsets
• Configurable 10-minute cadence step progression&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C084FC;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#6B21A8;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
