        <mxCell id="t3_53" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;margin-bottom:6px;&#x27;&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;background-color:#9333EA;color:#ffffff;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;&#x27;&gt;ISOLATED ENGINE CLONE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#6B21A8;margin-bottom:4px;&#x27;&gt;Isolated AnomalyDetector Instance&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:11px;color:#475569;line-height:1.35;&#x27;&gt;• Fresh, cloned instance of production AnomalyDetector
• Uses exact same 5 layers &amp;amp; conformal weights
• Strict isolation: Never writes to real stations
• Never modifies production detector singleton
• Simulation incidents isolated with source=TEST_SIMULATION&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C084FC;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#6B21A8;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
