        <mxCell id="leg_card1_57" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;margin-bottom:6px;&#x27;&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;background-color:#475569;color:#ffffff;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;&#x27;&gt;CONVENTION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#0F172A;margin-bottom:4px;&#x27;&gt;Implementation Convention&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:11px;color:#475569;line-height:1.35;&#x27;&gt;• ─── SOLID BORDERS: Fully implemented in repository
  (FastAPI endpoints, 5 layers, conformal fusion, SQLite DB, MapLibre)
• - - - DASHED BORDERS: Test Lab Isolated Simulation Environment
• ZERO invented services — all modules map 1:1 to codebase&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2775" y="1205" width="385" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg_card2_58" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;margin-bottom:6px;&#x27;&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;background-color:#0F766E;color:#ffffff;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;&#x27;&gt;MATHEMATICS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#0F172A;margin-bottom:4px;&#x27;&gt;Scientific Formulations&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:11px;color:#475569;line-height:1.35;&#x27;&gt;• Barometric SLP: P · (1 - 0.0065·h / 288.15)^(-5.255)
• Clausius-Clapeyron / Magnus: e_s = 6.112 · exp(17.67·T / (T+243.5))
• Spatial Kriging: T_cons = Σ(w_i · (T_i - Γ·Δh)) / Σ w_i
• Conformal P-Value: (Σ I(S_cal ≥ S) + 1) / (N_cal + 1)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3185" y="1205" width="400" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg_card3_59" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;margin-bottom:6px;&#x27;&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;background-color:#7E22CE;color:#ffffff;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;&#x27;&gt;WEIGHT DISTRIBUTION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#0F172A;margin-bottom:4px;&#x27;&gt;Layer Weighting &amp;amp; Conformal Significance&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:11px;color:#475569;line-height:1.35;&#x27;&gt;• Physics Weight: 0.35 (Thermodynamic Invariants)
• Temporal Weight: 0.25 (Kinematics &amp;amp; Frozen Sensor)
• Multivariate Weight: 0.20 (Psychrometric Coupling)
• Spatial Weight: 0.15 (Elevation-Adjusted Consensus)
• Drift Weight: 0.05 (CUSUM Cumulative Sum Chart)
• Conformal Significance Level: α = 0.001 (False Alarm Rate)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2775" y="1345" width="385" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg_card4_60" value="&lt;div style=&#x27;margin-bottom:6px;&#x27;&gt;&lt;span style=&#x27;background-color:#0369A1;color:#ffffff;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;&#x27;&gt;STANDARDS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#0F172A;margin-bottom:4px;&#x27;&gt;Meteorological Agency Compliance&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#x27;font-size:11px;color:#475569;line-height:1.35;&#x27;&gt;• World Meteorological Organization (WMO-No. 8 Standard)
• India Meteorological Department (IMD) AWS Compatibility
• Automated Telemetry Reliability for National Weather Networks
• Extreme Convective Events vs Sensor Degradation Triage&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
